  m_Name: Possible Escape
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JournalSO
  title: Possible Escape
  entry: Up ahead this long narrow hallway. Beware of what lurks. our team was taken
    out one by one. I am writing this as my vision blurs. There is a crack between
    walls with an oddly placed chair and a crimson floor. For those who come after-
    solve the mysteries of the catacombs.
